    {
      "text": "tender mercies of the Lord are over all, 1 Ne. 1:20. pray unto the Lord that he would have mercy, 1 Ne. 8:8. I will be merciful unto the Gentiles, 1 Ne. 13:33. how merciful the Lord had been in warning us, 2 Ne. 1:3. because of … his grace and mercy, 2 Ne. 9:53. Lord shall have no … mercy on their fatherless, 2 Ne. 19:17. mercy hath no claim on that man, Mosiah 2:39 (3:26). extending the arm of mercy towards them that put their trust in him, Mosiah 29:20. Lord, have mercy and spare my life, Alma 2:30. if it had not been for his … mercy, Alma 9:11. then will I have mercy upon you, Alma 12:33. have mercy on this man, Alma 15:10. remember his merciful arm, Alma 29:10. God is merciful unto all who believe on his name, Alma 32:22. mercy can satisfy the demands of justice, Alma 34:16. mercy restored unto you, Alma 41:14. perfect, just God, and a merciful God, Alma 42:15. do ye suppose that mercy can rob justice, Alma 42:25. son of perdition, for whom there was no mercy, 3 Ne. 29:7. repent … Lord did have mercy on them, Ether 11:8. children … alive in him because of his mercy, Moro. 8:19.",
