    {
      "text": "translate through the mercy of God, D&C 1:29. arm of mercy hath atoned for your sins, D&C 29:1. I will be merciful unto your weakness, D&C 38:14. called … by the voice of mercy, D&C 43:25. suiting his mercies according to the conditions, D&C 46:15. kept the covenant … shall obtain mercy, D&C 54:6. merciful unto those who confess, D&C 61:2. mercy hath compassion on mercy, D&C 88:40. I … show mercy unto all the meek, D&C 97:2. who receiveth you … shall obtain mercy, D&C 99:3. in the day of wrath I will remember mercy, D&C 101:9. Have mercy … upon the wicked mob, D&C 109:50. manifest myself to my people in mercy, D&C 110:7. we hear … A voice of mercy from heaven, D&C 128:19.",
